# This dependency-free example needs no configuration and no API keys — the demo
# and tests run on the standard library alone. This file is a placeholder for the
# production version, which retrieves against Dataverse under the operator's
# identity so row/column security applies:
#
# DATAVERSE_URL=<your-dataverse-environment-url>
# AZURE_TENANT_ID=<your-tenant-id>
# AZURE_CLIENT_ID=<your-client-id>
#
# Copy to .env and fill in only if you wire in live Dataverse. Never commit .env.
